rope tied around the neck. The silk has holes in the sides and bottom where green, scaly limbs emerge from, while a grotesque head pops out the top of the bag.<br /> <br /> <br /> Fairest - A beautiful maiden who appears to be wearing a giant pile of money. Her dress is sewn together from golden coins while priceless jewels adorn her head, arms and feet.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> How does this differ from the Mirrorskin kith, if you don't mind me asking? I think I already know the answer, but I'm still curious to know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T21:06:16-08:00","id":781530,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deionscribe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/504788-your-custom-kiths-newly-imagined?p=781501#post781501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> How does this differ from the Mirrorskin kith, if you don't mind me asking? I think I already know the answer, but I'm still curious to know.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Well some of these Kiths may have been created before the teaser list got updated. As for the difference, I thought Mirrorskin dealt with impersonating other beings;. Mimics would impersonate objects","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-07-2015, 12:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T03:25:47-08:00","id":781629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/504788-your-custom-kiths-newly-imagined?p=781530#post781530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for the difference, I thought Mirrorskin dealt with impersonating other beings;. Mimics would impersonate objects</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah. Missed that the first time. In that case, I can actually have an easy time picturing a True Fae who styles himself as a trickster, and has a large number of Mimics and Mirrorskins among his captives.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T06:24:32-08:00","id":794132,"title":"","content":"My own conversion of GottaGoFeast's Timekeeper kith. <hr /><br /> <u><b>Timekeeper:</b></u><br /> - As mortals, they may have been very punctual individuals, mindful of the hours in their daily routine. In Arcadia, they were given the duty to keep track of the strange passage of time, which was not always an easy task. They had to figure out the mad patterns of day and night to remember all the appointments of their Keepers' agendas, although they did not decide how time passed themselves. Some of this power still remains with them even after their escape.<br /> <br /> \u2022 Elemental - A human horologium in the shape of a well-chiselled statue.<br /> \u2022 Fairest - She shines with empyrean light, hair like a starry nebula and skin marked with the hues of a celestial body.<br /> \u2022 Wizened - The figure's body is studded with objects and materials associated with time, such as clocks, hourglasses, sand, water and quicksilver.<br /> <br /> <b>Blessing:</b> The Changeling has an absolute knowledge of exactly what time it is as measured locally, even if they\u2019ve spent the last day unconscious in a barren room. He can count down ticking seconds as accurately as a stopwatch, giving him the Good Time Management and Patient Merits for free. If he spends a point of glamour and performs an extended meditation roll with a target number equal to [11 - Wyrd], he can make use of the Omen Sensitivity Merit once per scene.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":8180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","user":"Deionscribe","date":". 12-30-2015, 03:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-29T21:40:26-08:00","id":795373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/504788-your-custom-kiths-newly-imagined?p=504809#post504809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm curious what culture Onigiri as gate-guardians is from because as far as I know onigiri are rice-balls with stuff in them (delicious, delicious rice balls).</div> </div> </div> </div>Indeed. They look like this: <a href=\"http://www.justhungry.com/images/onigiri.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.justhungry.com/images/onigiri.jpg</a><br /> <br /> Or, if you buy them at your local convenience store, like this: <a href=\"http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-MJU3_xucJ68/ULp2ZsbO_FI/AAAAAAAAIuk/F4pSjT3oiIc/s1600/3405DD6F-F029-414E-8093-4B58D975E546.JPG\" target=\"_blank\">http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-MJU3_xucJ6...58D975E546.JPG</a><br /> <br /> I'm mostly only saying this because right now in Japan on Twitter, onigiri is a trending topic because a famous comedian decided to make his baby look like an onigiri. <a href=\"https://twitter.com/eharamasahiro/status/611338853455007744\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/eharamasahiro/st...38853455007744</a><br /> <br /> This got thousands of followup efforts. <br /> <br /> (Also, I wanted to just note that I'm reading these. Super cool seeing people doing these custom 2e Kiths.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-29T22:56:01-08:00","id":795408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/504788-your-custom-kiths-newly-imagined?p=795373#post795373\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Indeed. They look like this: <a href=\"http://www.justhungry.com/images/onigiri.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.justhungry.com/images/onigiri.jpg</a><br /> <br /> Or, if you buy them at your local convenience store, like this: <a href=\"http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-MJU3_xucJ68/ULp2ZsbO_FI/AAAAAAAAIuk/F4pSjT3oiIc/s1600/3405DD6F-F029-414E-8093-4B58D975E546.JPG\" target=\"_blank\">http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-MJU3_xucJ6...58D975E546.JPG</a><br /> <br /> I'm mostly only saying this because right now in Japan on Twitter, onigiri is a trending topic because a famous comedian decided to make his baby look like an onigiri. <a href=\"https://twitter.com/eharamasahiro/status/611338853455007744\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/eharamasahiro/st...38853455007744</a><br /> <br /> This got thousands of followup efforts.<br /> <br /> (Also, I wanted to just note that I'm reading these. Super cool seeing people doing these custom 2e Kiths.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Stop, nooooooooo!<br /> <br /> I miss them so much ;_; When I lived in Japan I'd stop by Sunkus every morning to grab a few on the way to the ship. So delicious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T05:35:11-08:00","id":796788,"title":"","content":"Two more conversions into the 2e format. The Cleareyes from Winter Masques, and the Voidsoul by <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo\">MrParaduo</a>. <div align=\"center\"> <hr /></div> <br /> <b>Cleareyes:</b><br /> - Perhaps it was perfect eyesight, or excellent hearing, or even a remarkable sense of touch. Whatever their trademark senses were, it was what drew the attention of the Cleareyes' Keepers. In Arcadia, they were kept as lookouts and hunters, but their keen senses also allowed them to spy a way free of their masters.<br /> <br /> <b>\u2022 Beast:</b> Any animal known for its exemplary senses like the far-sighted eagle or the hound who can track any scent.<br /> <b>\u2022 Fairest</b>: An elf straight out of folktales, with a watchful, piercing gaze and long pointed ears that can pick up even the faintest of sounds.<br /> <b>\u2022 Wizened:</b> His flayed skin was replaced with a Hedgespun mesh, which easily analyzes the texture of anything it makes contact with.<br /> <br /> <b>Blessing:</b> The changeling gains the three-dot version of Trained Observer, as well as a bonus equal to his Wyrd on all perception rolls made with a trademark sense (sight, hearing, etc). If he spends a point of glamour while attempting one such roll, he benefits from the rote quality and can score an exceptional success at three successes instead of five.<br /> <br /> -=-<br /> <br /> <b>Voidsoul:</b><br /> - These changelings may have felt alone from their peers, or were somewhat detached from the world as mortals. When they were taken, though, they were intentionally left alone without anything or anyone to connect with. Soon, they end up so depersonalized with their environment that only the emptiness of the void is left. Voidsouls may have served as messengers and thieves for their masters, using their affinity for the space between spaces to slip over vast distances. This same power, though, came to be their means of escape if they proved faster and more clever than the Gentry.<br /> <br /> <b>\u2022 Darkling</b>: A gray-skinned person with hollow eyes and hair that is stark white or deep black.<br /> <b>\u2022 Elemental</b>: A wraith-like figure with slick, translucent skin that seems to shimmer whenever it moves. <br /> <b>\u2022 Ogre</b>: A hulking figure who seems to fill more space in a room than he actually does.<br /> <br /> <b>Blessing:</b> The changeling can spend a point of glamour to 'blink' out of existence and reappear anywhere within [Wyrd] yards of her initial location. Alternatively, he can spend a point of glamour to use the three-dot version of the Apportation Merit, and can ignore its drawbacks as long as it is apported within a distance of [Wyrd] yards.<br /> <br /> <div align=\"center\"> <hr /></div> For more details on the Apportation Merit, see this link...<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jM_bpQHo-dM4yop592S09y4AjQGLLTNhK5_0-5_85kg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jM_bpQHo-dM4yop592S09y4AjQGLLTNhK5_0-5_85kg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jM_bpQHo-dM4yop592S09y4AjQGLLTNhK5_0-5_85kg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jM_bpQHo-dM4yop592S09y4AjQGLLTNhK5_0-5_85kg/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-07T09:30:08-08:00","id":803162,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/504788-your-custom-kiths-newly-imagined?p=795408#post795408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Stop, nooooooooo!<br /> <br /> I miss them so much ;_; When I lived in Japan I'd stop by Sunkus every morning to grab a few on the way to the ship. So delicious.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> They are pretty easy to make, I used to make them for myself for lunch all the time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-07T12:28:42-08:00","id":803266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deionscribe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/504788-your-custom-kiths-newly-imagined?p=796788#post796788\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Cleareyes:</b></div> </div> </div> </div><i>Ben Stein Voice:</i> &quot;Cleareyes is awesome.&quot;<br /> <br /> ...Sorry","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T23:17:56-08:00","id":805836,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CatDoom</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/504788-your-custom-kiths-newly-imagined?p=803266#post803266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <i>Ben Stein Voice:</i> &quot;Cleareyes is awesome.&quot;<br /> <br /> ...Sorry</div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure how to interpret this as. But... Thanks?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-11T10:07:32-08:00","id":806190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://1d4chan.org/wiki/Changeling_Homebrew_Kiths\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://1d4chan.org/wiki/Changeling_Homebrew_Kiths\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://1d4chan.org/wiki/Changeling_Homebrew_Kiths\" target=\"_blank\"> https://1d4chan.org/wiki/Changeling_Homebrew_Kiths </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> A conversion of one of my favorite kiths from this list. <hr /><br /> <u><b>Magmasteeped:</b></u><br /> Even the most mild-mannered of people may boil with hidden resentment. Cast into Arcadian volcanoes, rivers of lava, and subterranean lakes of magma, these Changelings had their rage reforged to something truly devastating. Immersed in unforgiving liquid rock and metal that simmered, the sweltering heat and crushing pressure branded themselves into their being, just waiting for an opportunity to erupt. <br /> <br /> <b>\u2022 Beast:</b> A salamander with charcoal scales, whose body lights up in fiery patterns when angered.<br /> <b>\u2022 Elemental:</b> A figure sculpted from boiling rock, veins of magma visible on the surface.<br /> <b>\u2022 Fairest:</b> He appears to have skin reddened from prolonged exposure to the sun, but anyone who tries to touch him risks getting burned.<br /> <br /> <b>Blessing:</b> A Magmasteeped's form is imbued with the very lifeblood of the earth, and all it takes is a thought for it to be unleashed. He is immune to the effects of the Earthquake and Extreme Tilts, and can choose to reflexively inflict a point of lethal damage per turn on anyone grappling him (treat this damage as coming from a torch's flame). Furthermore, by spending glamour and rolling Presence + Wyrd, he can unleash both Tilts in an area up to a radius of [Wyrd x5] yards for a number of turns equal to successes rolled. The amount of glamour spent determines both the severity of the Earthquake Tilt and the penalty (maximum of -5) inflicted by the Extreme Heat Tilt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}